    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quæ si unique viduae de­ natrici ad mensuram centupli redderetur, sine dubia cunctis minus reciperet qua; minus omnibus intulis- set.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Unde et sanctus Petrus cum dixisset-: Ecce no. reliquimus omnia, et secuti sumus te (Matth- XIX, 27), qui certe,",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sicut lectio docet, nihil aliud quam retia reliquerat quibus tenuem victum piscandi artificio transigebat, responsum illi est:",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Omnis qui reliquerit domum, aut fratres, aut sorores, aut patrem, aut matrem a Hanc epislolam antea evulgaverat Baluzius in Appendice actorum veterum ad Agobardum, tom.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "II. pag. t5G. aut uxorem, aut filios, aut agros propter nomen meum, centuplum accipiet, et vitam æternam possidebit.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Namque cum in Scripturis sanctis centenarius numerus omni perfectione sacratus sit, discernite quod reddantur in cenluplum, non quæ tribuuntur Christi nomine, sed quæ pro Christi nomine relinquuntur:",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quia licet magna salutaris prosit merces eleemosynæ, incom­ parabiliter tamen majus est omnia dimittere, quam plurima dispensare.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quocirca definiat gloria vestra de solo istud martyrio prædicari, cnjus coronæ nul­ lum penitus meritum humani operis exæquatur.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Iste est centesimus fructus qui in futuro quidem vitam æternam exspectat, sed in præsenti quoque sæculo illatas martyribus contumelias mirificato honore com­ pensat.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Unde et alio Evangelii loco dominicus sermo testatur quod ad centenariam frugem cadens in ter­ ram bonam nutritæ sementis germen exierit.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Paren­ tes ergo, uxorem, vel filios, sive fratres pro Christi tantum consecrat nomine relinquendos, id est, cum pro asserenda nominis confessione,",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 504,
    "date_range": [
      490,
      518
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad#PL59.AD.5.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/avitus-viennensis/pl59_21_ad",
    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.5.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "non tantum hnjus­ modi necessitudinum, sed animarum quoque nobis corporumque facienda jactura sit.",
